{"4039320": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "KICK BUDS", "steam_appid": 4039320, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h1>Looking for playtesters!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Test Period: July 30, 2026, 4:00 a.m. - August 10, 2026, 2:00 a.m. (UTC)</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We’re going to run a playtest to improve “KICK BUDS”, a game we’re currently developing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your feedback and opinions will be used as a reference for future product development. We really appreciate your cooperation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-There is a limit to the number of test play participants. Once the limit is reached, you will no longer be able to join the test play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Players outside the supported regions cannot download this title from the store.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-The testing period and content may change without notice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Some features may be unavailable, and content may differ from the official release version.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Individual support for in-game issues will not be provided.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-This product is still in development, so unexpected problems or game crashes may occur.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Unscheduled maintenance may be performed during this test period.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Parameters and specifications may be changed without notice during this test period.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Test data cannot be carried over to the retail version.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-This title will not be available outside the test period.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>◆KICK BUDS Kicks Off!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s a 3v3v3 PvP soccer action game like you’ve never seen before!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or with friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All you need to do is move, jump, and shoot your way to the top!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>◆Two standout modes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>・ Soccer Royale</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>It’s 3v3v3—first team to score 5 goals wins!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3 teams scramble to score multiple balls into each other's nets.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jump into Ranked Match and test your skills! Team up with friends and enjoy co-op play.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>・ Party Royale</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every Buds for themselves in a battle royale with races, target practice, and more.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Win 3 rounds against 8 players to become the champion!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>◆Score a highlight-reel play!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Size up the field and take your best shot with a kick, header, or lob.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Score an overhead kick and become a high-flying football hero!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>◆Customize Your Character</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Express yourself with your Buds avatar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Show off your style on the field and steal the show!</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>◆KICK BUDS Kicks Off!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s a 3v3v3 PvP soccer action game like you’ve never seen before!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or with friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All you need to do is move, jump, and shoot your way to the top!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>◆Two standout modes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>・ Soccer Royale</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>It’s 3v3v3—first team to score 5 goals wins!</strong></p><p class=